 ("Disc herniation in the acute phase, glaucoma, uncontrolled high blood pressure.", "Острая грыжа диска, глаукома, неконтролируемое высокое давление.", "Akuter Bandscheibenvorfall, Glaukom, unkontrollierter Bluthochdruck.", "Hernie discale aiguë, glaucome, hypertension non contrôlée.", "Hernia discal aguda, glaucoma, presión alta no controlada.", "Ernia del disco acuta, glaucoma, pressione alta non controllata.", "Hérnia de disco aguda, glaucoma, pressão alta descontrolada."),
